{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":219600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5216.333494,"text":"Однако после потери калитки капитана Индия..."},{"kind":"text","t":5399.587786,"text":"However, after losing the captain's gate, India..."},{"kind":"audio","t":5439.264523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":5440.839924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":5441.977807,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":10633.093425000001,"text":"Совершила лишь 36 пробегов, потеряв 7 калиток для завершения."},{"kind":"text","t":10910.61603,"text":"It has only completed 36 runs, having lost 7 gates to finish."},{"kind":"audio","t":10952.846869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10954.056103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":10955.552233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10957.296988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":10957.442681,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":13076.721287,"text":"и нинксов."},{"kind":"text","t":13167.895158,"text":"and ninxes."},{"kind":"audio","t":13204.222158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":13204.442453,"samples":9232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22096.670833999997,"text":"В них обычно предлагается особая еда, напитки и развлечения, чтобы гости оставались в хорошем настроении и не покидали заведение."},{"kind":"text","t":22458.685807,"text":"They usually offer special food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests in a good mood and prevent them from leaving."},{"kind":"audio","t":22506.448027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22507.756623,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22509.346935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":22510.997438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22512.565410000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22513.984578000003,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":33389.916742,"text":"Дальпотр имел раннее преимущество во втором сете, но это также потребовало тайпбрейка после достижения..."},{"kind":"text","t":33736.920223,"text":"Dalpotr had an early advantage in the second set, but it also required a tiebreak after reaching..."},{"kind":"audio","t":33780.981867999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":33782.639451999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33784.222432999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33785.886546999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33787.56272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":33787.715824,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42557.145429,"text":"Интернет сочетает в себе элементы как массовых, так и межличностных коммуникаций."},{"kind":"text","t":42750.141085999996,"text":"The Internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42793.055358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42794.374403999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42795.961786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42797.61621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":42797.792152999995,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54594.802031,"text":"Во время сравнения при помощи инфракрасной фурье-спектроскопии выяснилось, что состав этих кристаллов соответствует кристаллам, найденным в моче пораженных домашних животных."},{"kind":"text","t":55028.656377,"text":"During comparison using infrared Fourier spectroscopy, it was found that the composition of these crystals matches those found in the urine of affected domestic animals."},{"kind":"audio","t":55078.600651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55080.222333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55081.782834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":55083.374416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":55085.03806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55086.671233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55088.310436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55090.01118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55091.100221,"samples":25856,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":68941.34166800001,"text":"На некоторых маршрутов у более крупных компаний есть свои собственные самолеты, но для других маршрутов и более мелких компаний с этим была проблема."},{"kind":"text","t":69296.95648200001,"text":"On some routes, larger companies have their own planes, but other routes and smaller companies faced difficulties with this."},{"kind":"audio","t":69345.476217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":69346.71169200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69348.312344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":69349.919987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69351.543659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":69353.23087300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":69353.435297,"samples":10392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":78901.96692400001,"text":"Некоторые атомы имеют нестабильное ядро, что означает, что они склонны распадаться при малом воздействии или без него."},{"kind":"text","t":79247.66528900001,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they tend to decay under slight influence or even without any influence."},{"kind":"audio","t":79293.059011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":79294.696654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":79296.358047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79298.02593100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79299.679374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79301.312497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":79301.926109,"samples":16992,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":84450.693146,"text":"В том же месяце другой авиалайнер выкатился за пределы взлетной полосы."},{"kind":"text","t":84657.580033,"text":"That same month, another airliner rolled off the runway."},{"kind":"audio","t":84699.16044800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":84700.48129400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84702.27267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":84702.409883,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":89326.324466,"text":"Меш Хеди и врезался в стену. Погибли 17 человек."},{"kind":"text","t":89552.921568,"text":"The Mesh Hedi also crashed into the wall. 17 people died."},{"kind":"audio","t":89591.540204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89593.26883900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89593.725378,"samples":14864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"audio","t":89625.830163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89626.609129,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":97408.828011,"text":"Почти все эти пляжи песчаные с безопасным купанием, и многие из них тенистые благодаря таким деревьям, как Пахутукапа."},{"kind":"text","t":97858.93660300001,"text":"Almost all of these beaches are sandy with safe swimming conditions, and many of them are shaded by trees such as the Pahuatukapa."},{"kind":"audio","t":97904.987939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97906.672573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97908.330036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97909.885177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97911.559701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97913.21232400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97914.52222,"samples":29592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":110817.98003600001,"text":"В популярные виды спорта входят футбол, баскетбол, волейбол, водное поло, фехтование, регби, велоспорт, хоккей на льду, хоккей на роликах и автогонки формула 1."},{"kind":"text","t":111292.27397400001,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":111343.021284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111344.33881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111346.048865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111347.528164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111349.13673700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111350.72433900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111352.45208300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111354.27455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":111354.418963,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116936.379392,"text":"В теплом климате Ближнего Востока дом не имел особого значения."},{"kind":"text","t":117195.154911,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house held little significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":117224.76602600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117226.387879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":117228.043502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117229.245406,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":127752.457164,"text":"Архипелаг располагается в 120 километрах от полуострова. Крупнейший остров носит имя короля Георга с поселением Вилье-Лас-Эстрельес."},{"kind":"text","t":128128.00713900001,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 kilometers from the peninsula. The largest island is named after King George, with the settlement of Viña Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":128171.90263000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128173.35145900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128174.984832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128176.71450700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":128176.84959000001,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":128211.75297100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128213.449685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128215.01728700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128216.70596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128218.13484900001,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":138471.580548,"text":"Капустный сок меняет цвет в зависимости от того, насколько кислотным или щелочным является химическое вещество."},{"kind":"text","t":138736.646293,"text":"Kale juice changes color depending on whether the substance is acidic or alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":138780.099376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138781.40070199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138783.05489499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138784.68205799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138785.36799099998,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":154147.94569,"text":"Согласно плану, мост полностью войдет в эксплуатацию в сентябре 2017 года, когда бразильские пункты таможенной проверки, как ожидается,"},{"kind":"text","t":154618.517234,"text":"According to the plan, the bridge will be fully operational by September 2017, when Brazilian customs checkpoints are expected to be in place."},{"kind":"audio","t":154667.868256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154669.454377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154671.168492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154672.807935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154674.419217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154676.07656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154677.75844399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154679.154572,"samples":29824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":154744.650608,"text":"будут завершены."},{"kind":"text","t":155119.872936,"text":"It will be fully operational by September 2017, when the Brazilian customs checkpoints are expected to be completed."},{"kind":"audio","t":155167.313429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155168.740038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155170.374781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":155171.96047299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155173.634226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155175.243768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":155175.607846,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164302.003352,"text":"Влага на наших руках вступит в реакцию с верхним слоем, что будет необычно, затем сформируется подобие оболочки."},{"kind":"text","t":164704.95273699999,"text":"The moisture on our hands will react with the top layer, which will be unusual, and then a sort of shell will form."},{"kind":"audio","t":164751.29884799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164752.87863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164754.479762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164756.10975499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":164757.753498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164758.91102099998,"samples":26960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":171842.530299,"text":"Одна из бомб взорвалась возле офиса генерал-губернатора."},{"kind":"text","t":172053.71187099998,"text":"One of the bombs exploded near the governor-general’s office."},{"kind":"audio","t":172095.682565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":172097.149664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172098.856738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":172098.989461,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":178850.70303099998,"text":"Султан Марокко перестроил город под названием Эддар-эль-Бейда."},{"kind":"text","t":179115.713795,"text":"Morocco’s sultan rebuilt a city named Ed-Dar el-Baida."},{"kind":"audio","t":179153.955153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179155.582276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179157.347221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":179157.487474,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":183953.028195,"text":"А испанские торговцы, создавшие тут торговые базы, назвали его Касабланка."},{"kind":"text","t":184216.204312,"text":"And the Spanish merchants who established trading posts here named it Casablanca."},{"kind":"audio","t":184267.612015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184269.014543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184270.568744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184272.281158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":184272.40573099998,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":196238.419924,"text":"Его приветствовал заместитель премьер-министра Сингапура Вонг Кан Сенг. Затем он обсудил вопросы торговли и терроризма с премьер-министром Сингапура Ли Сянь Луном."},{"kind":"text","t":196614.74987499998,"text":"He was welcomed by Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan Seng. He then discussed trade and terrorism issues with Singapore’s Prime Minister Lee Hsien Loong."},{"kind":"audio","t":196644.935591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196646.60881499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196648.262648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196649.257858,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"audio","t":196686.21667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196687.67231999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":196689.271762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196690.922475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196692.17315,"samples":28528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":207926.516224,"text":"Атомная бомба работает на том принципе, что для того, чтобы много протонов и нейтронов находились в одном ядре, необходима энергия."},{"kind":"text","t":208325.167673,"text":"An atomic bomb works on the principle that energy is required to keep many protons and neutrons together in a single nucleus."},{"kind":"audio","t":208372.07475499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208373.726389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":208375.387652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208376.949263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208378.608996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208380.312831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208381.553776,"samples":26592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":217876.52842699998,"text":"Исследуя архипелаги или посещая озёра, вы вполне сможете обойтись и без яхты."},{"kind":"text","t":218177.431712,"text":"When exploring archipelagos or visiting lakes, you can very well do without a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":218230.50677799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218231.892096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218233.44353699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218235.118421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218235.930027,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"close","t":229703.486847,"code":1005}]}